# Copy to .env (git does not keep it; devenv reads it, and the notebook takes its VITE_ lines).
#
# Connecting GitHub (optional: the notes are in the browser; GitHub keeps a copy). An OAuth app for
# development (https://github.com/settings/developers, "New OAuth App", callback URL
# http://localhost:5190/auth/callback): its id here, its id and secret in
# apps/auth-worker/.dev.vars (the auth worker: `devenv up` runs it at localhost:8787).
VITE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
# VITE_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:8787
